[00:23.203]I woke up to the fire,
[00:25.283]A quiet world that needed just a little extra light
[00:30.219]I reached for a burst of colors,
[00:32.307]painting over shadows till the black turns into white
[00:37.107]Baked a sweet illusion,
[00:39.427]raining sugar down to turn the heavy world around
[00:44.252]We're living in the moment
[00:46.531]like tomorrow never never ever will arrive
